LBR-One JIN JEONG-HYO (30)

51:05.312 --> 51:09.232
I don't speak English
and don't speak Korean well either.

51:09.357 --> 51:10.525
Am I okay?

51:51.566 --> 51:52.400
BREECH: A BABY POSITIONED
WITH ITS FEET FACING DOWNWARD

54:42.112 --> 54:43.363
The hospital I usually go to

54:43.571 --> 54:45.323
told me everything was fine.

54:51.579 --> 54:53.123
HAM DONG-HO

54:55.208 --> 54:56.543
I can't even make phone calls

54:56.960 --> 54:58.211
because I lost my phone.

54:58.545 --> 54:59.838
Have you seen my cell phone?

55:49.679 --> 55:51.431
Has something happened to my baby?

55:51.765 --> 55:53.308
He's not coming now, is he?

58:09.444 --> 58:10.278
It's okay.

58:10.612 --> 58:11.988
Husband come,

58:47.023 --> 58:48.608
SURGERY IN PROGRESS

